{"id":"07ba2917429a024e","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Adequate Set","display":"df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set — ZFC Forcing Adequate Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set — ZFC Forcing Adequate Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set — ZFC Forcing Adequate Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c5203cd487b6ba6d\" href=\"?note=c5203cd487b6ba6d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-domain.md\">../batch09/58-df-domain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X\">\\(\\mathcal X\\)</span> (the fixed club of countable Skolem-closed models in the adequate-set framework)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathcal X\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathcal X\\)</span> (adequate-set candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span> (comparison-point function determined by the fixed club <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Sk}_S)=\\mathcal X\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Sk}_S)=\\mathcal X\\)</span> (set-valued Skolem-hull function for the fixed structure)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingAdequateSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingAdequateSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(M,N)=\\beta(\\langle M,N\\rangle)\">\\(\\beta(M,N)=\\beta(\\langle M,N\\rangle)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sk}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Sk}_S\\)</span> 是第四个显式函数图参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sk}_S(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sk}_S(N)\\)</span> 为其函数值，不是另一个未定义谓词。该四参数关系保持相对于所给比较函数和 Skolem 函数的原有定义域。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}adequate\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingAdequateSet}_S(A,\\mathcal X,\\beta,\\operatorname{Sk}_S) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathcal X\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\;\\exists!\\alpha\\;(\\langle u,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Sk}_S)=\\mathcal X\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\exists!Y\\;(\\langle M,Y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S)\\land\\forall M,N\\in A\\;\\Bigl(M\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S(N)\\lor N\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S(M)\\lor M\\cap\\beta(M,N)=N\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}adequate\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingAdequateSet}_S(A,\\mathcal X,\\beta,\\operatorname{Sk}_S) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathcal X\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\;\\exists!\\alpha\\;(\\langle u,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Sk}_S)=\\mathcal X\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\exists!Y\\;(\\langle M,Y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S)\\land\\forall M,N\\in A\\;\\Bigl(M\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S(N)\\lor N\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S(M)\\lor M\\cap\\beta(M,N)=N\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Adequacy is relative to a fixed Skolemized structure, club <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span>, model class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X\">\\(\\mathcal X\\)</span>, and the resulting comparison-point function.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>John Krueger, <em>Forcing with Adequate Sets of Models as Side Conditions</em>, definition of an adequate set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$ (comparison-point function determined by the fixed club $\\Lambda$, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Sk}_S)=\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingAdequateSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta(M,N)=\\beta(\\langle M,N\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sk}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sk}_S(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}adequate\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingAdequateSet}_S(A,\\mathcal X,\\beta,\\operatorname{Sk}_S) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathcal X\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)=\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X\\;\\exists!\\alpha\\;(\\langle u,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Sk}_S)=\\mathcal X\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\exists!Y\\;(\\langle M,Y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S)\\land\\forall M,N\\in A\\;\\Bigl(M\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S(N)\\lor N\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\in\\operatorname{Sk}_S(M)\\lor M\\cap\\beta(M,N)=N\\cap\\beta(M,N)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X","display":false}],"bytes":2225,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1943","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-adequate-set]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","c5203cd487b6ba6d","36d7463d215be751"]}